<title>USA: Molex declares 25 percent stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Molex declares 25 percent stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LISLE, Ill. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Molex Inc said Monday its board of directors has declared a 25 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The electronic components company also said it will pay its regular quarterly dividend of $0.015 a share on the 25 percent stock dividend, effectively raising the quarterly dividend rate by 25 percent.  </p>
<p>Both the stock dividend and the quarterly cash dividend will be payable on April 25 to shareholders of record on March 31, the company said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
